# Maintainer: Jordan Bettcher <thebettcher@gmail.com>
#
# Copied into this tree from ~/Development/repo/archpower/chromium, which is
# a checkout of somebody else's git repository.  The ppc64le work in it --
# the _power8_compat toggle below, and the Debian patch series -- existed
# there only as an *uncommitted modification*, with power9-toggle.patch beside
# this file as its only tracked record, and that patch had already drifted out
# of date against the working copy it described.  RULES.md #3: only what is
# tracked survives, and one `git checkout` in that tree would have taken it.
# packages/ has priority over archpower in bq's source order, so this is now
# the recipe bq builds.  README.md in this directory explains the toggle and
# the patch audit behind it.
# Maintainer: Christian Heusel <gromit@archlinux.org>
# Maintainer: Jonathan Grotelüschen <tippfehlr@archlinux.org>
# Contributor: Evangelos Foutras <foutrelis@archlinux.org>
# Contributor: Pierre Schmitz <pierre@archlinux.de>
# Contributor: Jan "heftig" Steffens <jan.steffens@gmail.com>
# Contributor: Daniel J Griffiths <ghost1227@archlinux.us>

pkgname=chromium
